{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n196.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"29","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/1"}}
{"text":"Psalm of David: Ascribe to the Lord, sons of the powerful, ascribe to the Lord honour and might."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/2"}}
{"text":"Ascribe to the Lord the honour of His Name, bow down before the Lord in holy array."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/3"}}
{"text":"The voice of the Lord is above the waters, the God of glory has thundered, the Lord is above mighty waters."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/4"}}
{"text":"The voice of the Lord is power, the voice of the Lord is beauty."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/5"}}
{"text":"The voice of the Lord shatters cedars, the Lord shattered cedars of Lebanon."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/6"}}
{"text":"He made them skip like a calf, Lebanon and Sirion like young unicorns."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/8"}}
{"text":"The voice of the Lord makes the wilderness tremble, the Lord makes the wilderness of Kadesh tremble."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/9"}}
{"text":"The voice of the Lord causes hinds to calve, and strips forests and in His sanctuary everything expresses honour."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/10"}}
{"text":"The Lord was enthroned as King for eternity."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_29/psalms_29/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/11"}}
{"text":"The Lord gives strength to His people, the Lord blesses His people with peace."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
